@startuml
 title Password recovery sequence
actor user as U
participant client as C
participant recovery as F
database "SQL Server" as D
participant IAM as I
participant SMTP as M

U -> C: requests code for email
C -> F: POST /API/v1/password/forgot
F -> I: looks profile
I --> F: identity elegible
F -> D: saves hash of the code and vencimiento
F -> M: sends code
U -> C: enters code
C -> F: POST /forgot/verify
F --> C: token of restablecimiento
U -> C: enters password new
C -> F: POST /password/reset
F -> I: requests update protegida
I --> F: result
F --> C: confirmation or error
@enduml

